OL,3,GNEWSAWimborne boss hails FA Cup run as
OL,4,A'incredible reward'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWimborne Town Football Club are
OL,7,Fcelebrating reaching the second round
OL,8,Fof the FA Cup for the first time.
OL,10,FThe Southern League Premier Division
OL,11,FSouth side beat League Two Crawley
OL,12,FTown, 2-0, despite being three tiers
OL,13,Fand 57 places below them in the
OL,14,Ffootball league pyramid.
OL,16,FManager Tim Sills said the achievement
OL,17,Fhad "not fully sunk in" and said it was
OL,18,Fan "incredible reward" for the team's
OL,19,Fhard work this season.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
