OL,3,GNEWSAWimborne boss hails FA Cup run as
OL,4,A'incredible reward'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe added he'd had a a fitful night's
OL,7,Fsleep following the team's victory and
OL,8,Fwas set to go to the live draw. The
OL,9,FMagpies are ball 29 in the draw
OL,10,Fexpected to start at 18:45hrs GMT with
OL,11,Fsupporters invited to watch it live in
OL,12,Fthe clubhouse.
